> Millenium g450 and a LCD display. The X server works very nicely but
> takes nearly a minute to start. I was wondering if if comes from the
> fact that the X server does not initialize properly the graphic card
> because of a non-i386 architecture.

Yes, that's probably the case.

Try adding to the Device Section:

	Option	"NoINT10" "true"

to prevent the server from attempting to run the BIOS emulation.

